<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode cell-code" id="cb16"><pre class="sourceCode r code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb16-1"><a href="#cb16-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># Test: mortality rate difference between MORDOR and non-MORDOR states -----</span></span>
<span id="cb16-2"><a href="#cb16-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># boot_mort_state is a list of per-replicate tibbles (one row per state_type),</span></span>
