<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode cell-code" id="cb18"><pre class="sourceCode r code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb18-1"><a href="#cb18-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># Test: does the AVENIR ATE differ by MORDOR vs non-MORDOR state? -----</span></span>
