<section id="mortality-by-treatment-arm-and-mordor-village-overlap" class="level2" data-number="3">
<h2 data-number="3" class="anchored" data-anchor-id="mortality-by-treatment-arm-and-mordor-village-overlap"><span class="header-section-number">3</span> Mortality by treatment arm and MORDOR-village overlap</h2>
<p>Supplementary-figure-1-style forest plot of bootstrapped under-5 mortality rates (deaths per 1000 person-years, 1–59 mo) within the three MORDOR departments (Boboye, Falmey, Loga), split by treatment arm and by whether each AVENIR village overlapped a MORDOR trial village (matched within 1 km). Villages overlapping MORDOR received mass azithromycin during MORDOR, so a colour difference here would flag residual MORDOR exposure as a possible confounder of the AVENIR arm contrast. Two pooled rows are shown: <strong>Overall (MORDOR depts)</strong> pools only Boboye/Falmey/Loga, while <strong>Overall (all depts)</strong> pools every AVENIR department (where nearly all villages fall in the “no overlap” group). Point labels give the number of villages (grappes) contributing to each estimate.</p>
<div class="cell">
<details class="code-fold">
<summary>Code</summary>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode cell-code" id="cb20"><pre class="sourceCode r code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb20-1"><a href="#cb20-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># Prep: combined arm x overlap key -----</span></span>
<span id="cb20-2"><a href="#cb20-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># The key is passed as group_var below, so the bootstrap both resamples within</span></span>
<span id="cb20-3"><a href="#cb20-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># (district x arm x overlap) and reports by it; it is split back apart after</span></span>
<span id="cb20-4"><a href="#cb20-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># summarising. Build it once on all AVENIR data, then subset to MORDOR depts.</span></span>
<span id="cb20-5"><a href="#cb20-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>all_data <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> df_all <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb20-6"><a href="#cb20-6" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">mutate</span>(</span>
<span id="cb20-7"><a href="#cb20-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">match_grp =</span> <span class="fu">ifelse</span>(match_status, <span class="st">"Overlaps MORDOR"</span>, <span class="st">"No MORDOR overlap"</span>),</span>
<span id="cb20-8"><a href="#cb20-8" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">arm_match =</span> <span class="fu">paste</span>(isTreated_child, match_grp, <span class="at">sep =</span> <span class="st">"___"</span>)</span>
<span id="cb20-9"><a href="#cb20-9" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  )</span>
<span id="cb20-10"><a href="#cb20-10" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>mordor_dist <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> all_data <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> dplyr<span class="sc">::</span><span class="fu">filter</span>(mordorstate)</span>
<span id="cb20-11"><a href="#cb20-11" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb20-12"><a href="#cb20-12" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># Bootstrap two ways: per-department (+ pooled over MORDOR depts) and pooled -----</span></span>
<span id="cb20-13"><a href="#cb20-13" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># over all AVENIR depts. Each village count comes from the raw data, not the boot.</span></span>
<span id="cb20-14"><a href="#cb20-14" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="fu">set.seed</span>(<span class="dv">42</span>)</span>
<span id="cb20-15"><a href="#cb20-15" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>boot_mordor <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">boot_mort_rates</span>(mordor_dist, <span class="at">strat_var =</span> <span class="st">"district"</span>,</span>
<span id="cb20-16"><a href="#cb20-16" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                               <span class="at">n_boot =</span> <span class="dv">1000</span>, <span class="at">mc_cores =</span> avail_thr, <span class="at">group_var =</span> <span class="st">"arm_match"</span>)</span>
<span id="cb20-17"><a href="#cb20-17" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>boot_all    <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">boot_mort_rates</span>(all_data, <span class="at">strat_var =</span> <span class="cn">NA</span>,</span>
<span id="cb20-18"><a href="#cb20-18" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                               <span class="at">n_boot =</span> <span class="dv">1000</span>, <span class="at">mc_cores =</span> avail_thr, <span class="at">group_var =</span> <span class="st">"arm_match"</span>)</span>
<span id="cb20-19"><a href="#cb20-19" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb20-20"><a href="#cb20-20" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>overall_mordor_lab <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="st">"Overall</span><span class="sc">\n</span><span class="st">(MORDOR depts)"</span></span>
<span id="cb20-21"><a href="#cb20-21" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>overall_all_lab    <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="st">"Overall</span><span class="sc">\n</span><span class="st">(all depts)"</span></span>
<span id="cb20-22"><a href="#cb20-22" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb20-23"><a href="#cb20-23" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>boot_mordor_df <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">summarise_boot</span>(boot_mordor, <span class="st">"MortRate"</span>) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb20-24"><a href="#cb20-24" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">mutate</span>(<span class="at">district =</span> <span class="fu">ifelse</span>(district <span class="sc">==</span> <span class="st">"Overall"</span>, overall_mordor_lab, district))</span>
<span id="cb20-25"><a href="#cb20-25" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>boot_all_df <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">summarise_boot</span>(boot_all, <span class="st">"MortRate"</span>) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb20-26"><a href="#cb20-26" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">mutate</span>(<span class="at">district =</span> overall_all_lab)</span>
<span id="cb20-27"><a href="#cb20-27" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb20-28"><a href="#cb20-28" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># per-cell village counts, matching each plotted row's grouping</span></span>
<span id="cb20-29"><a href="#cb20-29" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>counts <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">bind_rows</span>(</span>
<span id="cb20-30"><a href="#cb20-30" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  mordor_dist <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> <span class="fu">count</span>(district, arm_match),</span>
<span id="cb20-31"><a href="#cb20-31" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  mordor_dist <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> <span class="fu">count</span>(arm_match) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> <span class="fu">mutate</span>(<span class="at">district =</span> overall_mordor_lab),</span>
<span id="cb20-32"><a href="#cb20-32" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  all_data    <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> <span class="fu">count</span>(arm_match) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> <span class="fu">mutate</span>(<span class="at">district =</span> overall_all_lab)</span>
<span id="cb20-33"><a href="#cb20-33" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>)</span>
<span id="cb20-34"><a href="#cb20-34" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb20-35"><a href="#cb20-35" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>match_levels <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">c</span>(<span class="st">"Boboye"</span>, <span class="st">"Falmey"</span>, <span class="st">"Loga"</span>, overall_mordor_lab, overall_all_lab)</span>
<span id="cb20-36"><a href="#cb20-36" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb20-37"><a href="#cb20-37" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>boot_match_df <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">bind_rows</span>(boot_mordor_df, boot_all_df) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb20-38"><a href="#cb20-38" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">left_join</span>(counts, <span class="at">by =</span> <span class="fu">c</span>(<span class="st">"district"</span>, <span class="st">"arm_match"</span>)) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb20-39"><a href="#cb20-39" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  tidyr<span class="sc">::</span><span class="fu">separate</span>(arm_match, <span class="at">into =</span> <span class="fu">c</span>(<span class="st">"isTreated_child"</span>, <span class="st">"match_grp"</span>), <span class="at">sep =</span> <span class="st">"___"</span>) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb20-40"><a href="#cb20-40" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">mutate</span>(</span>
<span id="cb20-41"><a href="#cb20-41" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">district        =</span> <span class="fu">factor</span>(district, <span class="at">levels =</span> match_levels),</span>
<span id="cb20-42"><a href="#cb20-42" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">isTreated_child =</span> <span class="fu">factor</span>(isTreated_child, <span class="at">levels =</span> <span class="fu">c</span>(<span class="st">"Control"</span>, <span class="st">"Treatment"</span>)),</span>
<span id="cb20-43"><a href="#cb20-43" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">match_grp       =</span> <span class="fu">factor</span>(match_grp, <span class="at">levels =</span> <span class="fu">c</span>(<span class="st">"No MORDOR overlap"</span>, <span class="st">"Overlaps MORDOR"</span>))</span>
<span id="cb20-44"><a href="#cb20-44" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  )</span>
<span id="cb20-45"><a href="#cb20-45" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb20-46"><a href="#cb20-46" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># Plot: arm on the y-axis, overlap status by colour, faceted by department -----</span></span>
<span id="cb20-47"><a href="#cb20-47" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>pd <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">position_dodge</span>(<span class="at">width =</span> <span class="fl">0.7</span>)</span>
<span id="cb20-48"><a href="#cb20-48" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb20-49"><a href="#cb20-49" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>mort_match_plot <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">ggplot</span>(</span>
<span id="cb20-50"><a href="#cb20-50" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  boot_match_df,</span>
<span id="cb20-51"><a href="#cb20-51" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">aes</span>(<span class="at">x =</span> MortRate_mean, <span class="at">y =</span> isTreated_child, <span class="at">color =</span> match_grp)</span>
<span id="cb20-52"><a href="#cb20-52" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb20-53"><a href="#cb20-53" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">geom_point</span>(<span class="at">position =</span> pd, <span class="at">size =</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb20-54"><a href="#cb20-54" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">geom_errorbar</span>(</span>
<span id="cb20-55"><a href="#cb20-55" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="fu">aes</span>(<span class="at">xmin =</span> MortRate_CI_low, <span class="at">xmax =</span> MortRate_CI_high),</span>
<span id="cb20-56"><a href="#cb20-56" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">position =</span> pd, <span class="at">width =</span> <span class="fl">0.3</span></span>
<span id="cb20-57"><a href="#cb20-57" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  ) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb20-58"><a href="#cb20-58" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  ggrepel<span class="sc">::</span><span class="fu">geom_text_repel</span>(</span>
<span id="cb20-59"><a href="#cb20-59" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="fu">aes</span>(<span class="at">label =</span> <span class="fu">paste0</span>(<span class="st">"n="</span>, n)), <span class="at">position =</span> pd,</span>
<span id="cb20-60"><a href="#cb20-60" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">size =</span> <span class="fl">2.5</span>, <span class="at">direction =</span> <span class="st">"both"</span>, <span class="at">seed =</span> <span class="dv">42</span>, <span class="at">max.overlaps =</span> <span class="cn">Inf</span>,</span>
<span id="cb20-61"><a href="#cb20-61" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">min.segment.length =</span> <span class="dv">0</span>, <span class="at">box.padding =</span> <span class="fl">0.5</span>, <span class="at">point.padding =</span> <span class="fl">0.3</span>, <span class="at">show.legend =</span> <span class="cn">FALSE</span></span>
<span id="cb20-62"><a href="#cb20-62" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  ) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb20-63"><a href="#cb20-63" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">facet_wrap</span>(<span class="sc">~</span> district, <span class="at">nrow =</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb20-64"><a href="#cb20-64" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">scale_color_manual</span>(<span class="at">values =</span> <span class="fu">c</span>(</span>
<span id="cb20-65"><a href="#cb20-65" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="st">"No MORDOR overlap"</span> <span class="ot">=</span> <span class="st">"#6E8537FF"</span>,</span>
<span id="cb20-66"><a href="#cb20-66" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="st">"Overlaps MORDOR"</span>   <span class="ot">=</span> <span class="st">"#8B174DFF"</span></span>
<span id="cb20-67"><a href="#cb20-67" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  )) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb20-68"><a href="#cb20-68" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">labs</span>(<span class="at">x =</span> <span class="st">"Mortality rate (deaths per 1000 py, 1–59 mo)"</span>, <span class="at">y =</span> <span class="cn">NULL</span>, <span class="at">color =</span> <span class="cn">NULL</span>) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb20-69"><a href="#cb20-69" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">theme_bw</span>(<span class="at">base_size =</span> <span class="dv">12</span>) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb20-70"><a href="#cb20-70" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">theme</span>(<span class="at">legend.position =</span> <span class="st">"bottom"</span>)</span>
<span id="cb20-71"><a href="#cb20-71" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb20-72"><a href="#cb20-72" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>mort_match_plot</span></code></pre></div><button title="Copy to Clipboard" class="code-copy-button"><i class="bi"></i></button></div>
</details>
