<section id="mortality-by-distance-to-nearest-mordor-village" class="level2" data-number="4">
<h2 data-number="4" class="anchored" data-anchor-id="mortality-by-distance-to-nearest-mordor-village"><span class="header-section-number">4</span> Mortality by distance to nearest MORDOR village</h2>
<p>Rather than the binary overlap flag, this bins every AVENIR village by its distance to the nearest MORDOR village into quantile (quartile) bins and shows the bootstrapped mortality rate per bin and arm, pooled across all AVENIR departments. A gradient across bins would suggest a dose-response with MORDOR proximity; a flat profile argues against residual MORDOR exposure driving the AVENIR arm contrast.</p>
<div class="cell">
<details class="code-fold">
<summary>Code</summary>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode cell-code" id="cb22"><pre class="sourceCode r code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb22-1"><a href="#cb22-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># Prep: quantile-binned distance to nearest MORDOR village -----</span></span>
<span id="cb22-2"><a href="#cb22-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>n_bins <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="dv">4</span></span>
<span id="cb22-3"><a href="#cb22-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>dist_breaks <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">quantile</span>(all_data<span class="sc">$</span>dist_nearest_mordor_km,</span>
<span id="cb22-4"><a href="#cb22-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                        <span class="at">probs =</span> <span class="fu">seq</span>(<span class="dv">0</span>, <span class="dv">1</span>, <span class="at">length.out =</span> n_bins <span class="sc">+</span> <span class="dv">1</span>), <span class="at">na.rm =</span> <span class="cn">TRUE</span>)</span>
<span id="cb22-5"><a href="#cb22-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb22-6"><a href="#cb22-6" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># Human-readable bin labels built from the breaks: "≤0.2", "0.2–27", …, "&gt;50"</span></span>
<span id="cb22-7"><a href="#cb22-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>brk <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">round</span>(dist_breaks, <span class="dv">1</span>)</span>
<span id="cb22-8"><a href="#cb22-8" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>bin_labs <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">paste0</span>(brk[<span class="sc">-</span><span class="fu">length</span>(brk)], <span class="st">"–"</span>, brk[<span class="sc">-</span><span class="dv">1</span>])</span>
<span id="cb22-9"><a href="#cb22-9" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>bin_labs[<span class="dv">1</span>] <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">paste0</span>(<span class="st">"≤"</span>, brk[<span class="dv">2</span>])</span>
<span id="cb22-10"><a href="#cb22-10" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>bin_labs[<span class="fu">length</span>(bin_labs)] <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">paste0</span>(<span class="st">"&gt;"</span>, brk[<span class="fu">length</span>(brk) <span class="sc">-</span> <span class="dv">1</span>])</span>
<span id="cb22-11"><a href="#cb22-11" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb22-12"><a href="#cb22-12" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>dist_data <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> all_data <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb22-13"><a href="#cb22-13" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  dplyr<span class="sc">::</span><span class="fu">filter</span>(<span class="sc">!</span><span class="fu">is.na</span>(dist_nearest_mordor_km)) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb22-14"><a href="#cb22-14" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">mutate</span>(</span>
<span id="cb22-15"><a href="#cb22-15" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">dist_bin =</span> <span class="fu">cut</span>(dist_nearest_mordor_km, <span class="at">breaks =</span> dist_breaks,</span>
<span id="cb22-16"><a href="#cb22-16" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                   <span class="at">include.lowest =</span> <span class="cn">TRUE</span>, <span class="at">labels =</span> bin_labs, <span class="at">dig.lab =</span> <span class="dv">2</span>),</span>
<span id="cb22-17"><a href="#cb22-17" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="co"># combined arm x distance-bin key (same trick as above)</span></span>
<span id="cb22-18"><a href="#cb22-18" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">arm_bin =</span> <span class="fu">paste</span>(isTreated_child, dist_bin, <span class="at">sep =</span> <span class="st">"___"</span>)</span>
<span id="cb22-19"><a href="#cb22-19" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  )</span>
<span id="cb22-20"><a href="#cb22-20" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb22-21"><a href="#cb22-21" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="fu">set.seed</span>(<span class="dv">42</span>)</span>
<span id="cb22-22"><a href="#cb22-22" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>boot_dist <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">boot_mort_rates</span>(dist_data, <span class="at">strat_var =</span> <span class="cn">NA</span>,</span>
<span id="cb22-23"><a href="#cb22-23" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                             <span class="at">n_boot =</span> <span class="dv">1000</span>, <span class="at">mc_cores =</span> avail_thr, <span class="at">group_var =</span> <span class="st">"arm_bin"</span>)</span>
<span id="cb22-24"><a href="#cb22-24" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb22-25"><a href="#cb22-25" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>dist_counts <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> dist_data <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> <span class="fu">count</span>(arm_bin)</span>
<span id="cb22-26"><a href="#cb22-26" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb22-27"><a href="#cb22-27" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>boot_dist_df <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">summarise_boot</span>(boot_dist, <span class="st">"MortRate"</span>) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb22-28"><a href="#cb22-28" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">left_join</span>(dist_counts, <span class="at">by =</span> <span class="st">"arm_bin"</span>) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb22-29"><a href="#cb22-29" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  tidyr<span class="sc">::</span><span class="fu">separate</span>(arm_bin, <span class="at">into =</span> <span class="fu">c</span>(<span class="st">"isTreated_child"</span>, <span class="st">"dist_bin"</span>), <span class="at">sep =</span> <span class="st">"___"</span>) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span></span>
<span id="cb22-30"><a href="#cb22-30" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">mutate</span>(</span>
<span id="cb22-31"><a href="#cb22-31" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">isTreated_child =</span> <span class="fu">factor</span>(isTreated_child, <span class="at">levels =</span> <span class="fu">c</span>(<span class="st">"Control"</span>, <span class="st">"Treatment"</span>)),</span>
<span id="cb22-32"><a href="#cb22-32" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">dist_bin        =</span> <span class="fu">factor</span>(dist_bin, <span class="at">levels =</span> <span class="fu">levels</span>(dist_data<span class="sc">$</span>dist_bin))</span>
<span id="cb22-33"><a href="#cb22-33" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  )</span>
<span id="cb22-34"><a href="#cb22-34" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb22-35"><a href="#cb22-35" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"># Plot: dose-response of mortality across distance bins, by arm -----</span></span>
<span id="cb22-36"><a href="#cb22-36" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>pd <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">position_dodge</span>(<span class="at">width =</span> <span class="fl">0.4</span>)</span>
<span id="cb22-37"><a href="#cb22-37" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb22-38"><a href="#cb22-38" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>dist_plot <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">ggplot</span>(</span>
<span id="cb22-39"><a href="#cb22-39" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  boot_dist_df,</span>
<span id="cb22-40"><a href="#cb22-40" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">aes</span>(<span class="at">x =</span> dist_bin, <span class="at">y =</span> MortRate_mean, <span class="at">color =</span> isTreated_child, <span class="at">group =</span> isTreated_child)</span>
<span id="cb22-41"><a href="#cb22-41" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb22-42"><a href="#cb22-42" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">geom_line</span>(<span class="at">position =</span> pd) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb22-43"><a href="#cb22-43" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">geom_point</span>(<span class="at">position =</span> pd, <span class="at">size =</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb22-44"><a href="#cb22-44" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">geom_errorbar</span>(</span>
<span id="cb22-45"><a href="#cb22-45" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="fu">aes</span>(<span class="at">ymin =</span> MortRate_CI_low, <span class="at">ymax =</span> MortRate_CI_high),</span>
<span id="cb22-46"><a href="#cb22-46" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">position =</span> pd, <span class="at">width =</span> <span class="fl">0.2</span></span>
<span id="cb22-47"><a href="#cb22-47" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  ) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb22-48"><a href="#cb22-48" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  ggrepel<span class="sc">::</span><span class="fu">geom_text_repel</span>(</span>
<span id="cb22-49"><a href="#cb22-49" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="fu">aes</span>(<span class="at">label =</span> <span class="fu">paste0</span>(<span class="st">"n="</span>, n)), <span class="at">position =</span> pd,</span>
<span id="cb22-50"><a href="#cb22-50" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">size =</span> <span class="fl">2.5</span>, <span class="at">direction =</span> <span class="st">"y"</span>, <span class="at">seed =</span> <span class="dv">42</span>,</span>
<span id="cb22-51"><a href="#cb22-51" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">min.segment.length =</span> <span class="dv">0</span>, <span class="at">box.padding =</span> <span class="fl">0.3</span>, <span class="at">show.legend =</span> <span class="cn">FALSE</span></span>
<span id="cb22-52"><a href="#cb22-52" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  ) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb22-53"><a href="#cb22-53" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">scale_color_manual</span>(<span class="at">values =</span> <span class="fu">c</span>(<span class="st">"Control"</span> <span class="ot">=</span> <span class="st">"#8B174DFF"</span>, <span class="st">"Treatment"</span> <span class="ot">=</span> <span class="st">"#6E8537FF"</span>)) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb22-54"><a href="#cb22-54" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">labs</span>(<span class="at">x =</span> <span class="st">"Distance to nearest MORDOR village (km, quartile bins)"</span>,</span>
<span id="cb22-55"><a href="#cb22-55" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>       <span class="at">y =</span> <span class="st">"Mortality rate (deaths per 1000 py, 1–59 mo)"</span>, <span class="at">color =</span> <span class="cn">NULL</span>) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb22-56"><a href="#cb22-56" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">theme_bw</span>(<span class="at">base_size =</span> <span class="dv">12</span>) <span class="sc">+</span></span>
<span id="cb22-57"><a href="#cb22-57" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="fu">theme</span>(<span class="at">legend.position =</span> <span class="st">"bottom"</span>)</span>
<span id="cb22-58"><a href="#cb22-58" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb22-59"><a href="#cb22-59" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>dist_plot</span></code></pre></div><button title="Copy to Clipboard" class="code-copy-button"><i class="bi"></i></button></div>
</details>
